HUI.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c9a1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx11237-bpOKNBsD5nAU.jpg"},"description":"Even though studying at a prestigious art school like Yamabuki is hard work, the girls who live at the Hidamari Apartments always manage to squeeze in time for a little fun and exploration. And when they actually get a day off? Watch out world! Yuno, Sae, Hiro, Miyako and new students Nori and Nazuna return to create another masterpiece of life as art, with all new adventures that include swimming, pajama parties, trips to the art museum and even an all-you-can-eat diner courtesy of the landlady! Of course, there&rsquo;s always a little housework that has to be squeezed in, but with a pinch of resourcefulness and a dash of creativity, even the most onerous of chores can be turned into something magical. <br><br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":6,"month":11,"year":2011},"episodes":2,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":78,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["PREQUEL",9563,9563,"ANIME","SPECIAL"],["SEQUEL",11239,11239,"ANIME","TV"],["SOURCE",31362,1362,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2011,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":30,"month":10,"year":2011},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":14,"score":10},{"amount":5,"score":20},{"amount":8,"score":30},{"amount":21,"score":40},{"amount":91,"score":50},{"amount":240,"score":60},{"amount":649,"score":70},{"amount":955,"score":80},{"amount":549,"score":90},{"amount":335,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":94,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":1644,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":4390,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":68,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":77,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[[44,"Shaft",true,true],[376,"Sentai Filmworks",false,false]],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Hidamari Sketch x SP","native":"ひだまりスケッチ×SP","romaji":"Hidamari Sketch × SP"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793711343},"11239":{"al":11239,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11239-IH1qkMFp2tgR.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#f16b50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx11239-JysRplnD2e0P.jpg"},"description":"Studying at the Yamabuki Arts High School has been a dream-come-true for Yuno, and she's learned so much already! And not just from her instructors, but from her friends and neighbors who've become her second family and made the Hidamari Apartments such a safe and nurturing home. But as the day of her \"big sisters\" Sae and Hiro's graduation draws slowly closer, it's time for Yuno to start seriously taking on the same role for Nazuna, Nori and the other budding young artists who've entered Hidamari's protective cocoon. And it's also time to tackle some really challenging artistic assignments. That doesn't mean there won't still be time for fun with Miyako and all the others, but it's definitely time to pencil in her plans for the future. And sometimes that means you have to put the art before the course!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":21,"month":12,"year":2012},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"HIDIVE","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.hidive.com/tv/hidamari-sketch-x-honeycomb"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"https://www.tbs.co.jp/anime/hidamari/"}],"genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":81,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"TV","rank":322,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":null},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":9,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":100,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR",